    "text": "Share:\nDelaware Defense Day event\nDelaware Defense Day event, 10 a.m. to 4 p.m., Fort Miles, Cape Henlopen State Park, Lewes. Reenactments, firing demonstrations, historic vehicles, live music in Orientation Building, free, food & refreshments available for purchase, cost is $6 for entrance to museum, park entrance fee in effect, shuttle parking is at McBride Beach Bathhouse in park. For details go to fortmilesmuseum.org.\nl\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 04/25/2026 - 10:00am to 4:00pm",
